<article class="man-page theme-light" data-man-version="1" data-man-title="MAN-TOOL" data-man-section="1" data-man-date="2026-10-21" data-man-source="Linux" data-man-manual="User Commands">
<header class="document-header"><h1>MAN-TOOL(1)</h1><p class="manual-meta">User Commands · Linux · 2026-10-21</p></header>
<section data-kind="section" data-node-id="2" data-source-start="124" aria-labelledby="man-node-2">
<h2 id="man-node-2"><strong>NAME</strong><a class="permalink" href="#man-node-2" aria-label="Link to NAME">#</a></h2>
<p data-kind="paragraph" data-node-id="3" data-source-start="133">man-tool - inspect a source document</p>
</section>
<section data-kind="section" data-node-id="4" data-source-start="171" aria-labelledby="man-node-4">
<h2 id="man-node-4"><strong>SYNOPSIS</strong><a class="permalink" href="#man-node-4" aria-label="Link to SYNOPSIS">#</a></h2>
<p data-kind="paragraph" data-node-id="5" data-source-start="184"><strong>man-tool</strong> [<strong>-</strong><strong>v</strong>] [<strong>-</strong><strong>o</strong> <em>file</em>] <em>input</em></p>
</section>
<section data-kind="section" data-node-id="6" data-source-start="231" aria-labelledby="man-node-6">
<h2 id="man-node-6"><strong>DESCRIPTION</strong><a class="permalink" href="#man-node-6" aria-label="Link to DESCRIPTION">#</a></h2>
<p data-kind="paragraph" data-node-id="7" data-source-start="247">Read <em>input</em> and inspect its structure.</p>
<p data-kind="paragraph" data-node-id="8" data-source-start="292">Output preserves the original source independently of canonical text.</p>
<section data-kind="subsection" data-node-id="9" data-source-start="362" aria-labelledby="man-node-9">
<h3 id="man-node-9"><strong>Input formats</strong><a class="permalink" href="#man-node-9" aria-label="Link to Input formats">#</a></h3>
<p data-kind="paragraph" data-node-id="10" data-source-start="382">The first implementation handles typical Linux man pages.</p>
</section>
</section>
<section data-kind="section" data-node-id="11" data-source-start="440" aria-labelledby="man-node-11">
<h2 id="man-node-11"><strong>OPTIONS</strong><a class="permalink" href="#man-node-11" aria-label="Link to OPTIONS">#</a></h2>
<dl class="definitions" data-kind="definition-list" data-node-id="12" data-source-start="452">
<dt data-kind="item" data-node-id="13" data-source-start="452" data-value="8" id="man-node-13"><strong>-</strong><strong>v</strong></dt>
<dd style="margin-inline-start:4em"><p data-kind="paragraph" data-node-id="14" data-source-start="465">Display verbose diagnostics on standard error.</p>
</dd>
<dt data-kind="item" data-node-id="15" data-source-start="512" data-value="8" id="man-node-15"><strong>-</strong><strong>o </strong><em>file</em></dt>
<dd style="margin-inline-start:4em"><p data-kind="paragraph" data-node-id="16" data-source-start="532">Write the selected document to <em>file</em>.</p>
</dd>
<dt data-kind="item" data-node-id="17" data-source-start="574" data-value="2" id="man-node-17">•</dt>
<dd style="margin-inline-start:1em"><p data-kind="paragraph" data-node-id="18" data-source-start="585">No automatic includes or external commands.</p>
<div class="indent" data-kind="indent" data-node-id="19" data-source-start="629" data-value="4" style="margin-inline-start:2em">
<p data-kind="paragraph" data-node-id="20" data-source-start="635">Indented explanatory text.</p>
</div>
</dd>
</dl>
</section>
<section data-kind="section" data-node-id="21" data-source-start="666" aria-labelledby="man-node-21">
<h2 id="man-node-21"><strong>EXAMPLES</strong><a class="permalink" href="#man-node-21" aria-label="Link to EXAMPLES">#</a></h2>
<pre class="preformatted" data-kind="preformatted" data-node-id="22" data-source-start="679"><code>  man-tool -v input.1
  man-tool -o output.txt input.1
</code></pre>
</section>
<section data-kind="section" data-node-id="23" data-source-start="742" aria-labelledby="man-node-23">
<h2 id="man-node-23"><strong>SEE ALSO</strong><a class="permalink" href="#man-node-23" aria-label="Link to SEE ALSO">#</a></h2>
<p data-kind="paragraph" data-node-id="24" data-source-start="755"><span class="man-reference" data-reference="man(7)">man(7)</span>, <span class="man-reference" data-reference="printf(3)">printf(3)</span></p>
</section>
<section data-kind="section" data-node-id="25" data-source-start="780" aria-labelledby="man-node-25">
<h2 id="man-node-25"><strong>AUTHORS</strong><a class="permalink" href="#man-node-25" aria-label="Link to AUTHORS">#</a></h2>
